### Inter Assist — listar planes (API externa)
GET {{interassistBaseUrl}}/api/planes?page=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{interassistToken}}

### Inter Assist — detalle de un plan
GET {{interassistBaseUrl}}/api/planes?id=1679
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{interassistToken}}

### Inter Assist — promociones por emisión (candidato a resolver IDs)
# Los planes traen "promociones": [127, ...] — este endpoint debería devolver el detalle.
# Si falla el body, probar variantes abajo según el error 422.
POST {{interassistBaseUrl}}/api/ventas/promocionesemision
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{interassistToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empresa_id": 927,
  "tipo_emision": 0
}

### Inter Assist — promocionesemision (variante con plan)
POST {{interassistBaseUrl}}/api/ventas/promocionesemision
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{interassistToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empresa_id": 927,
  "plan_id": 881,
  "tipo_emision": 0
}

### Inter Assist — intentar GET promo por ID (si existe catálogo)
GET {{interassistBaseUrl}}/api/promociones/127
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{interassistToken}}

### Inter Assist — listar promociones (si existe)
GET {{interassistBaseUrl}}/api/promociones
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{interassistToken}}

### App — login
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{appEmail}}",
  "password": "{{appPassword}}"
}

### App — cotizar unico_viaje (incluye Inter Assist)
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "departure_date": "2026-09-01",
  "return_date": "2026-09-12",
  "ages": [30],
  "origin": "AR",
  "destination_id": 2,
  "trip_type": "unico_viaje"
}

### App — cotizar multiviaje (Inter Assist usa _30_dias_anual)
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "departure_date": "2026-09-01",
  "return_date": "2027-08-31",
  "ages": [30],
  "origin": "AR",
  "destination_id": 2,
  "trip_type": "multiviaje"
}

### Inter Assist — emitir-externa (API externa; no cotiza)
POST {{interassistBaseUrl}}/api/ventas/emitir-externa
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{interassistToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 0,
  "plan_id": 802,
  "promocion_id": 0,
  "data_inicial": "20/06/2026",
  "data_final": "27/06/2026",
  "clientes": [
    {
      "nombre": "Maria",
      "apellido": "Garcia",
      "fecha_nacimiento": "15/03/1990",
      "email": "maria.garcia@example.com",
      "dni": "30123456",
      "telefono": "1144556677"
    }
  ]
}

### App — países Inter Assist (REST Countries)
GET {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/inter_assist/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Accept: application/json

### App — provincias AR Inter Assist (Georef)
GET {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/inter_assist/countries/AR/provinces
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Accept: application/json

### App — provincias otro país (vacío)
GET {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/inter_assist/countries/BR/provinces
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Accept: application/json

### App — abrir venta Inter Assist
# Reemplazar quote_id/amount/plan_name con un plan real de POST /v1/quotes
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "company": "inter_assist",
  "quote_id": "802",
  "quote": {
    "departure_date": "2026-06-20",
    "return_date": "2026-06-27",
    "ages": [35],
    "origin": "AR",
    "destination_id": 3,
    "trip_type": "unico_viaje",
    "amount": "120.50",
    "currency": "USD",
    "plan_name": "INTER 100",
    "promocion_id": 0
  }
}

### App — pasajeros Inter Assist
@saleId = 1
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/{{saleId}}/passengers
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "receive_promotions": false,
  "emergency_contact": {
    "first_name": "Luis",
    "last_name": "Perez",
    "phone": "+5491100000001",
    "email": "luis.perez@example.com"
  },
  "passengers": [
    {
      "is_holder": true,
      "first_name": "Maria",
      "last_name": "Garcia",
      "birth_date": "1991-03-15",
      "document_type": "dni",
      "document_number": "30123456",
      "email": "maria.garcia@example.com",
      "phone": "1144556677",
      "country_id": "AR",
      "province_id": "BA",
      "country": "Argentina",
      "province": "Buenos Aires",
      "street": "Av. Ejemplo",
      "street_number": "123",
      "city": "Buenos Aires"
    }
  ]
}

### App — iniciar pago simulado
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/{{saleId}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "payment_method_id": "simulated",
  "return_url_ok": "https://panel.example/ok",
  "return_url_error": "https://panel.example/error",
  "return_url_pending": "https://panel.example/pendiente"
}

### App — simular pago aprobado
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/{{saleId}}/payment/simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "result": "approved"
}

### App — confirmar pago (emite en Inter Assist si approved)
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/{{saleId}}/payment/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Accept: application/json

### App — retomar venta
GET {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/{{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Accept: application/json

### App — PDF voucher Inter Assist (proxy; requiere JWT)
# No abrir la URL de api-staging.interassist.com en el browser: pide API Key → 401.
GET {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/{{saleId}}/voucher/pdf?lang=es
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Accept: application/pdf
